<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>MA1 BATTLE V2</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#0d0d0d;color:white;font-family:Arial;overflow:hidden;touch-action:none}
#lobby{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(#222,#000);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:20}
.shop{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.card{background:#1a1a1a;border:2px solid #333;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;width:100px;text-align:center}
.card.active{border-color:gold}
#hud{position:absolute;top:0;width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;z-index:5}
#joy{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:20px;width:110px;height:110px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:50%;z-index:6}
#stick{position:absolute;width:50px;height:50px;background:rgba(255,215,0,0.6);border-radius:50%;left:30px;top:30px}
#jumpBtn{position:absolute;bottom:30px;right:30px;width:80px;height:80px;background:gold;border-radius:50%;border:none;font-size:30px;z-index:6}
canvas{display:block}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="lobby">
<h1>🔫 MA1 BATTLE V2</h1>
<div>💰 <span id="cash">0</span></div>
<div class="shop" id="shop"></div>
<button onclick="startBattle()" style="background:gold;padding:15px 35px;border:none;border-radius:20px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:10px">▶️ ابدأ</button>
<p style="font-size:11px;opacity:0.6">جوال: استخدم الدائرة تمشي، الزر الاصفر تنط | كمبيوتر: WASD + SPACE</p>
</div>
<div id="hud"><div id="hp">❤️ 100</div><div id
